    "chunk_text": "\u00f0\u00e6m w\u00e6s gecueden to \u00f0\u00e6m lytegan feonde, \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6s \u00e6restan monnes mod ontynde on \u00f0\u00e6s Suelce he openlice cu\u00e6de: On giefernesse & on unnytum ge\u00f0ohtum \u00f0u ricsas\u00f0 ofer \u00f0a menniscan For\u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0e on giefernesse ongietene beo\u00f0 wile folgian fierenlust. \u00d0\u00e6t cy\u00f0de se witga, \u00f0a he \u00f0\u00e6t openlice s\u00e6de \u00f0\u00e6tte sua gewear\u00f0, & \u00f0\u00e6t gebiecnede \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0a giet \u00d0ara koka ealdormon bi\u00f0 sio womb, for\u00f0\u00e6m eall hiera gesuinc & hiera \u00f0enung belimpe\u00f0 to \u00d0a weallas \u00f0onne Hierusalem getacnia\u00f0 \u00f0a m\u00e6genu \u00f0\u00e6re saule. \u00d0a m\u00e6genu beo\u00f0 ar\u00e6redu mid wilnunge to \u00f0\u00e6re uplican sibbe. Ac \u00f0ara koka ealdormon towierp\u00f0 \u00f0a weallas Hierusalem. \u00d0\u00e6t is, \u00f0onne \u00f0onne sio wamb bi\u00f0 a\u00f0ened mid fylle for giefernesse, \u00f0onne towierp\u00f0 hio \u00f0urh Ongean \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0onne is to cy\u00f0anne \u00f0\u00e6m f\u00e6stendum, gif \u00f0\u00e6s modes forh\u00e6fdnes ful oft mid Ne cu\u00e6de he no sua, gif he ne ongeate \u00f0\u00e6t him w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6s wana, ac for\u00f0y\u00f0e he ongeat \u00f0\u00e6t sio Gif eac sio scyld \u00f0ara ofermetta ne gewundode \u00f0y oftor \u00f0\u00e6t mod \u00f0\u00e6s f\u00e6stendan, \u00f0onne ne & eft he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Kolosensum, \u00f0a he ongeat \u00f0\u00e6t hie gulpun hiera f\u00e6stennes: Oft \u00f0onne mon ma Gif \ufffd",
